/v1/","context":{"app_id":4887270,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4887270-1847286114039784","game_id":"steam-4887270","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 2","summary":"Demo hotfix 2 | October 24 (1/2) Changes since Demo hotfix 1 (October 19).A dark storm now chases the plane after takeoff and speeds up at each island. If it catches the plane, the run ends. Watch for THE STORM IS CLOSING IN!Pigs left behind by the storm die and respawn on the deck. Islands behind the storm clear away.The edge of the sky is now a pale storm wall instead of a wolf army. Fly into it and gusts turn the plane back. Loose pigs on the deck get a gentle shove.Two cannons on the third i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T14:43:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114039784","verified_at":"2026-10-24T18:05:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4887270-1846651706692993","game_id":"steam-4887270","kind":"update","title":"Demo Hotfix 1","summary":"Demo hotfix 1 Changes since the October 8 tagged demo. The farm opening now has a giant wolf tornado, flying farm junk, and a falling wolf statue head. Hold any key or button to skip the opening for the whole crew. Retry goes straight back to play. Moving storms pull at the plane and throw tumbling junk. Sky portals warn you before wolf rings arrive. Mouse steering is now the default flight control. Keyboard flight remains available, and Left Alt lets you look around. Start in first person on fo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T22:53:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692993","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:26:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4887270-1846651706672992","game_id":"steam-4887270","kind":"announcement","title":"Wolf storms, mouse flight, and a new crew HUD","summary":"Howdy, pilots! The farm has a wolf tornado, the sky has moving storms, and pigs left behind have a cannon ride back to the crew. Here's what's changed since the October 8 demo update. A stormy start Watch the crew repair its cart beneath a giant wolf tornado. A falling wolf statue head kicks off the run and lifts farm junk into the air. Hold any key, mouse button, or gamepad button for one second to skip the opening for everyone. Retry goes straight back to play. Moving storms gather along the r","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T02:51:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706672992","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:26:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4887270-1846018067929751","game_id":"steam-4887270","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.1.1583: Four Islands, Plane Health, and a Louder Sky","summary":"Howdy, pilots! The trip just got longer, the plane can take a few hits before it falls apart, and the wolves finally have voices. We're updating the When Pigs Fly demo. Here's what's in version 0.1.1583. A longer trip Four islands. Land in the barn on each island, drive through, and take off again. Land in the last barn to win. The fence on the barn approach is gone, so nothing snags the plane on the way in. A cloud floor. Fall into the clouds and you get a warning and a puff before you respawn ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T13:47:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929751","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:26:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4887270-1845383656394633","game_id":"steam-4887270","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.1.1474: Repair Feedback, More Wolves, and Drifting Junk","summary":"Howdy, pilots! We’re updating the demo with more wolves, drifting farm junk, and clearer wrench feedback.REPAIRS • Four threaded bolts appear above the Repair prompt and spin into place with your wrench impact, complete with a little puff of dust. • The prompt refreshes as you repair and now says “Repair” instead of “Whack.”A BUSIER SKY • Up to 12 flying wolves can be active instead of 6. Waves arrive every 10 seconds instead of 20, with up to 8 wolves per wave instead of 4. • Wolf missiles are ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T21:03:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656394633","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:26:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4887270-1845383656384113","game_id":"steam-4887270","kind":"announcement","title":"The free demo is out!","summary":"Grab 1-3 friends, build a plane out of junk while wolves chase you, then keep it flying while wolves in biplanes shoot it apart. Missing parts change how it flies. Falling off is half the fun.Play the demo: If you have a good time, wishlisting the full game helps us a ton. Something break? Come tell us what broke in our Discord: https://discord.gg/DNbjspHMp4","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T21:30:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656384113","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:26:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4887270":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:08:23Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":